// Copy this file to Signing.xcconfig (git-ignored) and fill it in.
// build.sh copies it for you if Signing.xcconfig is missing, which is enough for the
// CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO compile check but not for installing on a phone.

// Your 10-character Team ID from https://developer.apple.com/account (Membership details),
// or the one Xcode shows for your free Apple ID under Settings > Accounts > Manage
// Certificates. This repo's owner: 44F896V7UJ
//
// Fill it in before running from Xcode onto a phone. Leaving it empty is fine for
// ./build.sh, which does not sign.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

// Automatic signing (set in project.yml) is not optional here: the App Group
// group.com.codywright.aside has to exist in your developer account and be listed in both
// provisioning profiles, and Xcode only registers it for you in Automatic mode.
